nexus installation scripts for setup

--> yum install java-21-amazon-corretto -y

# do not install nexus in root or any user account --> specific or default folder is available in server ---> opt/

# nexus download in linux url -- https://help.sonatype.com/en/install-nexus-repository.html

--> cd /opt
--> wget https://download.sonatype.com/nexus/3/nexus-3.95.3-02-linux-x86_64.tar.gz

# now we need to untar of gz file

--> tar -zxvf nexus  enter-Tab

after it looks like this 
//
drwxr-xr-x. 6 root root        94 Aug 29 16:17 nexus-3.95.3-02
-rw-r--r--. 1 root root 531959835 Aug 29 16:16 nexus-3.95.3-02-linux-x86_64.tar.gz
drwxr-xr-x. 3 root root        20 Aug 27 16:22 sonatype-work
//

--> cd /nexus-3.95.3-02
--> cd /bin
--> ./nexus start
//
  when we start this, it will show a msg called : Detect execution as "root" user. this is not recommended!
  why --> because he only declaring that with in the root user nexus doesn't have permission so creat new user and run there

  so, go to /opt folder and creat a user called nexus and provide permissions to both nexus-3.95.3-02 / sonatype-work
//
--> userdd nexus

#back to root user and opt folder

--> chown -R nexus:nexus-3.95.3-02 sonatype-work/
--> ls -lrt  

# you able to see root --> nexus is changed owner to all the permissions

